<h3>METANTHROPES</h3>
<h5>Welcome to <strong><span style="font-family: &#x27;Metanthropes&#x27;">Metanthropes</span></strong>, a new
	setting-flexible, d100
	TTRPG that embraces classless progression &amp; boundless creativity, about ordinary individuals with extraordinary
	gifts.</h5>
<br>
<p class="welcome-message"><em>With <strong>100 @METAICON(metanthropes) Metapowers</strong> and over 500 unique
		abilities at
		your
		fingertips, possibilities are limitless, shaped only by the stories you choose to tell.</em></p>
